    "about": "I started Ashgrove after a harvest where we sold wine we did not actually have. Independent wineries are asked to run like consumer brands and like manufacturers at the same time, usually with a cellar team of three. We build the system of record for what is in tank, in barrel, and on the dock, so a sales promise matches a physical bottle. I spend most weeks in cellars, not on stages."
